/span>: Hi V, I'm so glad Candice got you to do this with me!\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me too. It feels great to lend a helping hand.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: It sure does. I've already spoken with a few of the underprivileged folks that we will be serving. For the most part they're wonderful people who have fallen on hard times.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll be honest, though, I'm a bit nervous. I don't think I can do this alone.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: You don't have to do it alone. It says right here in your volunteering handbook: \u201cNew volunteers shall be accompanied by a senior volunteer at all times.\u201d", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Oh no! That little leaflet? I thought it was junk mail, so I threw it out! I really should have read it. What else did it say?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well, it says that \u201call volunteers shall complete a background check\u201d and \u201cvolunteers shall not bring personal belongings into the kitchen.\u201d\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Phew. I got my police check sent directly to them, so that's taken care of. And I'll get a senior volunteer to store my purse in one of the lockers.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Great, well let's get started then!\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What should we do first?", "id": 2, "time": "31500", "image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well these plates are all dirty. They clearly should have been cleaned by the first shift of helpers. I think we ought to wash them.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely, and we probably ought to scrub the countertops, right?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Good thinking. Why don't you start with that while I get the team leader to make a list of duties for us?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like a plan. I'm so glad you're here, Amy. I feel better about this already!", "id": 3, "time": "64500", "image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}